{"unit_id":"flyHZJ__dsh-turn-nav#feature-index","repo":"flyHZJ/dsh-turn-nav","commit":"65c764a0dc91569ba3c2a34bf8d410e76874cf61","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-turn-nav 的功能「历史轮次导航」：组件扫描当前会话中已渲染的用户或 steering 行，为每个轮次生成编号入口；没有用户行时回退显示助手步骤或轮次尾。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:128-163"]}
